One catch: on `/problems/inventory-blind`, `d17-problems.css` defines a generic `.desk` pill rule (amber, translateX(-50%)) that leaks into a943's desk div — that's the left-crop cause. I need to neutralise the pill properties in the phone block too.
The generic `.desk` pill rule in `d17-problems.css` also leaks at desktop widths on `/problems/inventory-blind` (amber pill background, `translateX(-50%)` — same left-crop cause). I'll guard the base `.a943 .desk` rule too, since that page loads problems.css.
